<metadata><name>Day 75 - Ilse Hanel, Warder, Cemetery Road</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.990102" lon="-81.242282"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>McCurdy Drive Municipal Parking Lot (off of Moore St.): Online booking is required -…</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.987503" lon="-81.239102"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Warder Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.986357" lon="-81.227364"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Ilse Hanel Side Trail, heading east. (the blue-blazed Ilse Hanel Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.968698" lon="-81.225886"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Cemetery Road Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed Ilse Hanel Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.967267" lon="-81.230547"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: End of the Cemetery Road Side Trail. There is trailhead parking here (Parking area outside the Lion's Head Provincial Nature Reserve gate, accessible from…). Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.989703" lon="-81.233136"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off behind you.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
